            </note>
            <note corresp="#d340-f2" n="7" xml:id="d340-f2-content">
                <p>Not printed. On June 19 a note from the Chinese Ambassador indicated his
                    Government’s acceptance of the U.S. proposal (894.30/6–1947).</p>
            </note>
            <note corresp="#d340-f3" n="8" xml:id="d340-f3-content">
